      "writtenOn": "2026-01-29T17:59:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Calling this HC with `FP_FRAME_GET_ENCRYPTED_TEMPLATE` command results in `EC_RES_UNAVAILABLE` if the `FP_ENCRYPTED_TEMPLATE_READY` is not set. The bit is not set if `encrypt_template()` fails.\n\nDoes that sound good to you?",
